---
description: STORY skill-root ownership and duplicate discovery rules
alwaysApply: true
---

STORY ships one neutral skill source under `.agents/skills/` and harness entry trees for Claude, Cursor, DeepSeek Harness, Kimi Code, Pi, and Qwen Code. Byte-identical files in the entry trees are relative links to `.agents`; harness-only frontmatter remains a real file in its owning tree.

Cursor must always load `.cursor/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`, even when duplicate discovery surfaces the same skill from `.agents/skills/` first. The `.agents` copy is the neutral shared source, not Cursor's entry point. Ignore `.claude`, `.dsh`, `.kimi-code`, `.pi`, and `.qwen` copies unless the user explicitly asks to inspect another harness.

Six skills are explicit-only and carry `disable-model-invocation: true` in the Cursor tree: `story-proj-adopt`, `story-syns-coach`, `story-outl-planner`, `story-revs-resolver`, `story-defn-builder`, and `story-depo-packer`. Do not start one unless the user chose it directly.

`SKILL.md` is the only skill manifest; a run in Chinese follows it and replies in Chinese.
